<title>UK: Draft LEP opens new facility in Brisbane.</title>
<headline>Draft LEP opens new facility in Brisbane.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>LEP International has opened a new cargo handling and administration facility near Brisbane International Airport, on the East coast of Australia, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Sited at Eagle Farm it replaces LEP's office and warehouse in central Brisbane and is designed to meet increasing business in the Queensland region.</p>
<p>It includes a Customs bonded area, which enables inbound airfreight to be recovered directly from the international airport after arrival. - Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+5017</p>
<p>www.racs.com</p>
